{
 "name": "Bang",
 "notes": "The first second of everything, every minute. A fireball in the middle, white at its heart, through gold and red to violet and the dark; rays and sparks to the edges. The hour and the minute stand black against the fire, rimmed with heat; a shock wave leaves the fire at the second 0 and reaches the edge at 59. The weekday bends along an arc over the fire, the day in gold, the month black at the rim of the fire; weather and heart, steps and charge below, pressed to the axis from both sides. Every picture is drawn by make_case.py.",
 "font": "Oswald",
